  "title": "Find a paid service"
 },
 "description": "Search paid x402 APIs and datasets by need. Ranked: verified first, then probe score, then price. Each result carries what you choose on: status, score (0..1), evidence_tier, paid_verified (we bought it with real USDC and it delivered), has_sample (a cheap preview exists), price. Describe the actual need in query, in your own words: that text drives relevance. Zero results means nothing listed matches; do not invent endpoints. Results are dated evidence, not guarantees. Returns a summary per listing; detail='full' returns every field. Call get_service_details before paying. Free, read-only.",
 "inputSchema": {
